🕹️ Tic Tac Toe Game

A modern, professional Tic Tac Toe web app built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
It features a smooth, responsive UI, dark/light mode toggle, and instant gameplay — all optimized for speed and performance.
LINK-https://koduruvijaykumar.github.io/Tic-Tac-Toe-Game/

🎯 Features

🧠 Classic 3×3 Tic Tac Toe logic

⚡ Smooth and fast gameplay (no lag)

🌗 Light & Dark theme toggle with animated icon

💡 Highlight effect for winning combination

🌀 Reset button to restart the game instantly

📱 Fully responsive (works on phones, tablets, and PCs)

🎨 Clean modern UI with glowing accent colors

🧩 Technologies Used
Technology	Purpose
HTML5	Structure of the app
CSS3	Styling and animations
JavaScript (ES6)	Game logic and interactivity
Remix Icon	Theme toggle icons

🎮 How to Play

Player X starts first.

Click on a cell to make your move.

The next turn switches to Player O.

The game announces the winner or a tie.

Press 🔄 Reset Game to play again.


